s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:51.949Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","session_id":"58180680-f247-4dc3-9364-e9b7fb45d054","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"5387234f-5693-41a1-9917-ac2943d7451d","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"c78d1b91-366a-4109-9d0f-65e67377a7eb","thread":"5387234f-5693-41a1-9917-ac2943d7451d","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-c78d1b91-366a-4109-9d0f-65e67377a7eb"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-iswqrc9k/state/worktrees/1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","base_commit":"99fe843d747d7ba5e9faf8b1118bc94beadb0744","card_snapshot_id":"34a91026-62d3-43c2-9d68-4da267d2344c","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:53.147Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-iswqrc9k/repo","cat-file","-t","7bee20b638f5a3499318f498194fb01216734298"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-iswqrc9k/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:53.152Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-iswqrc9k/repo","cat-file","-t","7bee20b638f5a3499318f498194fb01216734298"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-iswqrc9k/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:53.152Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"1edbafb2-ca82-4771-b65f-3f60656d1d11","type":